[33.4422, "o", "PASS  'homebrew' owns every file in /opt/homebrew\r\n"]
[33.4749, "o", "PASS  brew --version works for admin\r\nPASS  wrapper is in /usr/local/share/homebrew-shared-mac\r\n\r\nNext\r\n  1. Open a new Terminal window, or run: source ~/.zshrc\r\n  2. Test it (this asks for YOUR password): brew update\r\n  3. For each other person: log in as that person and run:\r\n       echo 'source /usr/local/share/homebrew-shared-mac/brew-wrapper.zsh' >> ~/.zshrc\r\n\r\nReport for your AI agent: /Users/admin/shared-brew-report-20261124-161708.txt\r\nThe report lists the account names on this Mac. Read it before you share it.\r\n"]
